        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/pokemon-30-alex-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Sitting at my desk and racking my brain for something, <em>anything</em> to say about Pok&eacute;mon for its thirtieth anniversary, I found myself inexplicably struggling. What do you say about a series like this? With Zelda, there's easy lines to trace about it as both reflection and architect of many an era's trends. I could write about the anniversary of Final Fantasy in about a hundred different ways. I even had easy words for NFL Blitz. But Pok&eacute;mon... What do you say?</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/the-older-pokemon-and-i-get-the-more-i-appreciate-its-greatest-asset-inter-generational-brilliance\">Read more</a></p>",
